        <mxCell id="c102" value="&lt;i&gt;Rows 11 to 18 of the Ex 8.2 worksheet in two views, columns A to F and then G and H. Selected and outlined: F18, whose formula is in the bar, the unexplained difference of zero. The three reconciling rows are the opening entry, a negative amount, and the two Debt Reclass entries, positive amounts, because the invoice detail still shows those invoices as open. PurchaseInvoiceID is read from each entry&#x27;s description.&lt;/i&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12;fontColor=#5D6D7E;fontStyle=0;fontFamily=Helvetica;spacing=2;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="0" y="778" width="860" height="53" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
